[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9920","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0010","text":"为了什么而继续飞翔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9921","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0020","text":"要朝着何方继续飞翔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9922","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0030","text":"当我成为我之时\n我失去了继续飞翔的理由"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9940","text":"冬优子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0040","text":"对不起！\n请再来一遍……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0049","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0050","text":"对阳希酱来说，画画\n是那么重大的事啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0060","text":"……对冬优酱来说的偶像\n也是那样的存在吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0070","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0080","text":"好痛……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0090","text":"前几天和放课后的成员们踢了足球\n肌肉酸痛还没消呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0100","text":"…………啊，嗯……\n听起来好开心的样子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0110","text":"这痛感才好啊？\n有种活着的感觉嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0120","text":"…………不不……\n那种────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0130","text":"那──────是你所期望的颜色吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0140","text":"啊哈哈\n日花，你这家伙……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0150","text":"好，去吃饭吧\n附近有家好吃的店"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0160","text":"啊————————\n────真是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0170","text":"…………上钩了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0180","text":"冬优酱，总觉得……对偶像这件事\n抱着非常特别的情感……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9923","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0190","text":"我────这宇宙永恒的中心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9924","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0200","text":"不断追寻无形轮廓的，孤独之旅"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9900","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0210","text":"…………黛小姐……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9925","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0220","text":"在无人注目的，这个宇宙中……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9926","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0230","text":"唯一确定的，只有这个宇宙的终结"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9927","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0240","text":"在没有终点也没有起点、不断重复的无限彷徨中\n我──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9941","text":"冬优子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0250","text":"对冬优来说，偶像是……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0260","text":"对自己撒谎，到此为止吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9928","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0270","text":"拥抱着名为我的诅咒────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9929","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0280","text":"直到这个宇宙终结\n我将永远彷徨下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9901","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0290","text":"────黛小姐！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9942","text":"冬优子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0300","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9902","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0310","text":"跟剧本完全不一样啊！\n台词也不对，表演也是错的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0320","text":"……啊\n对、对不起！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9903","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0330","text":"……\n从头再来一遍────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9904","text":"动画导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0340","text":"────等等"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9905","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0350","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9906","text":"动画导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0360","text":"刚才那场……保留\n就按那个状态一直演到最后吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9907","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0370","text":"不，可是……！\n内容差了这么多，要怎么处理啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9908","text":"动画导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0380","text":"抱歉。我会配合表演，把剧情走向和结局重新写一遍\n总之，现在的表演就先保留着用吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9909","text":"动画导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0390","text":"黛小姐，台词就像刚才那样即兴发挥就好，\n请保持表演的氛围，顺着感觉演下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0391","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9910","text":"动画导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0400","text":"因为你的演技，我觉得主题终于对上了\n带着自信去完成吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0410","text":"……\n────好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0411","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0420","text":"制作人，看起来好辛苦啊\n有没有什么我能帮上忙的呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0421","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0430","text":"…………会不会……给他添麻烦呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0431","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0440","text":"确实，推出新的形象\n对她们今后的发展来说，我认为也是必要的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0441","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0442","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0450","text":"没关系的，真乃！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0460","text":"嗯\n制作人也一定会高兴的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0461","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0462","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0463","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0470","text":"即便如此……我相信，她们随心而行的姿态\n一定能打动粉丝们的心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0480","text":"…………啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0481","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0482","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0483","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0490","text":"……\n我们也要加油才行！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0491","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0492","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9930","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0500","text":"我会永远飞翔下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_9931","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_08_0510","text":"直到那双眼睛找到我"}]
